{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52434","headline":"回波乐 七十七 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 七十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不净脓血（一作「流」）袋，四大共爲因（戴校「身」）。\n六贼都成体，败坏一时分。\n风者吹将散，火者焰来亲。\n水者常流急，土者合成人。\n体骨变爲土，还归足下尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}